{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Array length", ALGOL 68 solution array-length.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Array_length#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/array-length.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
{ UPB returns the upper bound of an array, LWB the lower bound }
[]string fruits = ( "apple", "orange" );
print( ( ( UPB fruits - LWB fruits ) + 1, newline ) ) { prints 2 }
)
